<title>GREECE: Athens bourse OKs auto dealer Sfakianakis IPO.</title>
<headline>Athens bourse OKs auto dealer Sfakianakis IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the initial public offering prospectus of automobile trading company Sfakianakis for listing on the bourse's main market.</p>
<p>Sfakianakis AEBE which mainly sells Suzuki vehicles will issue 2,125,000 common shares of which 100,000 will be privately placed, the bourse said.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
